@startuml use-case-diagram
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam wrapWidth 180
skinparam maxMessageSize 180

title LeafyMap — cas d'utilisation (vue globale)

actor "Visiteur\n(sans compte)" as Visitor
actor "Guest\n(inscrit)" as Guest
actor "Creator" as Creator
actor "Admin" as Admin

Visitor <|-- Guest
Guest <|-- Creator

actor "Google" as Google
actor "AWS S3" as S3
actor "Brevo" as Brevo
actor "Mapbox" as Mapbox

rectangle LeafyMap {
  usecase "Rechercher créateurs,\nlieux et événements" as Search
  usecase "Filtrer la recherche" as Filter
  usecase "S'inscrire" as Register
  usecase "Se connecter" as Login
  usecase "Gérer ses favoris" as Favorites
  usecase "Noter un lieu\nou un événement" as Review
  usecase "S'inscrire à\nun événement" as Book
  usecase "Devenir creator" as BecomeCreator
  usecase "Gérer son lieu\net ses événements" as ManagePlace
  usecase "Gérer les partenariats" as Partnerships
  usecase "Modérer contenus\net utilisateurs" as Moderate

  Filter ..> Search : <<extend>>
}

Visitor -- Search
Visitor -- Register
Visitor -- Login

Guest -- Favorites
Guest -- Review
Guest -- Book
Guest -- BecomeCreator
Guest -- Partnerships

Creator -- ManagePlace

Admin -- Moderate

Login -- Google
Register -- Google
Register -- Brevo
Search -- Mapbox
ManagePlace -- S3

note bottom of Admin
  Admin = rôle, pas un type de profil.
  Un admin peut être guest ou creator.
end note

@enduml
